[{"title":"寄弟君典","author":"朱德琏","text":"搔首飞蓬四载馀，尔音听玉几回虚。\n天边雁阵都成字，壁上蜗涎宛作书。\n露草侵阶苍藓滑，烟罗绕径绿筠疏。\n何堪骨肉同寥落，南北无由慰索居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"朱德琏","text":"偶闻《渌水曲》，欲托黄金徽。\n弦手不相应，心随别鹤飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钟陵行","author":"袁九淑","text":"濮阳书生有仙骨，往因合与神仙匹。\n山头邂逅琼台姬，沉吟绣繻甲障诗。\n怪风裂屋天符下，采鸾谪向文箫嫁。\n笑携纤手归钟陵，茅茨栖隐垂古藤。\n书生命薄何蹇促，玉茧银钩尚堪鬻。\n得钱沾酒日归来，消摇取醉南山曲。\n以兹稍稍为人知，越玉山深好息机。\n相携跨虎潜踪去，更敕青霞封石扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词","author":"袁九淑","text":"天上春难老，人间日易曛。\n指挥青鸟使，亲近碧霞君。\n冠偃蛾眉月，衣裁华岳云。\n往来灵仗拥，仙乐夜深闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日斋居杂书 其一","author":"袁九淑","text":"妆成出幽阁，芳径寂无哗。\n林润涵朝雨，窗明带曙霞。\n鹤栖醒酒石，鸟啄睡香花。\n长笑耶溪女，春风自浣纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日斋居杂书 其二","author":"袁九淑","text":"雨过小池绿，苔生白板扉。\n玄言深玉麈，幽思托金徽。\n远笛兼莺语，飞花趁燕归。\n相看贫亦好，安用泣牛衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居杂书示王孙 其一","author":"袁九淑","text":"操杵力不任，当垆心自鄙。\n花时掩关坐，焚香读《秋水》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居杂书示王孙 其二","author":"袁九淑","text":"长笑里俗儿，闺中相尔汝。\n因思安丰妇，由来卿婿古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园踏青","author":"邓氏女（闽县","text":"芍药丛边露气沉，步随芳草共幽寻。\n桃花薰日红浓淡，柳叶迷烟翠浅深。\n何处香泥忙社燕，谁家晴槛噪时禽。\n悄寒罗袜浑无力，斜倚东风碧树阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其一","author":"姚氏（青蛾居士","text":"晚烟翠出草亭斜，曲曲深村小筑家。\n几点病鸥眠夜月，半林残雪照梨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其二","author":"姚氏（青蛾居士","text":"帘卷轻寒春帐空，梦残芳草雨催风。\n隔窗阵阵声偏急，狼籍庭前一夜红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺词","author":"王虞凤","text":"融和天气喜初晴，为爱簪花却放针。\n玉枕梦回人寂寂，瑶琴挥罢院沈沈。\n绿鸳戏水穿荷影，紫燕衔泥织柳阴。\n昼静金炉香欲尽，推窗满地落红深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听画船梢妇打歌用吴歌体","author":"刘苑华","text":"画船女儿打吴歌，缥缈风烟莎接么。\n却与桨声相应节，到来只是唤哥哥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后江望","author":"尹纫荣","text":"雨后水更明，秋风渐渐声。\n寒天白露满，江上晓烟横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野望","author":"尹纫荣","text":"野望无山色，长天一抹清。\n陌树齐如画，其下有人行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行 其一","author":"陆卿子","text":"君不见春风枝上华灼灼，春风日日吹华落。\n人生且莫恋悲欢，朱颜却被悲欢烁。\n悲欢未尽年命尽，罢却悲欢两寂寞。\n惟馀夜月流清晖，华间叶底空扉扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行 其二","author":"陆卿子","text":"君不见垂髫儿，倏忽为人父。\n君不见青蛾女，终作东家姥。\n又不见华堂列绮筵，清歌杂妙舞。\n须臾烛尽乐无声，寂寂寥寥何所睹。\n人生亦如斯，一往无今古。\n白日不肯住，红颜渐成土。\n短歌行，声最苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万历宫词 其一","author":"陆卿子","text":"高烧蜡炬吐青烟，妃子宫中夜宴阑。\n并坐圣容欢不足，罗衣却恐怯春寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万历宫词 其二","author":"陆卿子","text":"玉貌凄凉锁翠眉，强移罗袜出深帷。\n莫嫌衰谢同秋草，记得春风第一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万历宫词 其三","author":"陆卿子","text":"锦帐灯明玉殿高，六宫归去夜迢迢。\n莫言远角声悲切，月到披香最寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万历宫词 其四","author":"陆卿子","text":"兰芷萧条白露凝，夜深台殿起秋声。\n君恩何处中天月，一片清光处处明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行","author":"陆卿子","text":"白马骄青云，金鞭拂红雾。\n相逢不问名，各自东西路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"陆卿子","text":"青天如水月如霜，万里无云杀气凉。\n夜半征人齐堕泪，胡笳声短雁声长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨 其一","author":"徐媛","text":"金屋香吹粉黛香，夜寒高碧见河梁。\n双星不向人间照，冷尽梨花白玉床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨 其二","author":"徐媛","text":"脉脉深宫桂殿凉，阿娇金屋夜飞霜。\n千金莫买相如赋，白首文君怨已长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春忆外","author":"沈纫兰","text":"映日初花隔槛明，春风袅袅透寒轻。\n伤心怕听枝头鸟，莫向王孙归路鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼柔卿遗扇","author":"沈纫兰","text":"物在人亡空自悲，泪痕时共落花垂。\n泉台若有回峰雁，寄我衷肠知不知？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和会稽女子","author":"黄双蕙","text":"憔悴天涯对阿谁，若为多露独含悲。\n空怜子夜孤亭泪，尽作霜枫带雨垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中闻子规","author":"黄淑德","text":"陌上柳条新，逢春倍惜春。\n忽闻啼杜宇，愁杀未归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"黄淑德","text":"鹊驾成桥事有无，年年今夕会星娥。\n时人莫讶经年隔，犹胜人间长别多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"黄淑德","text":"春风日日闭深闺，柳老花残莺自啼。\n寂寞小窗天又暮，一钩新挂月楼西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晚","author":"黄淑德","text":"柳外慵蝉噪晚霞，风床书卷篆烟斜。\n凭阑自爱秋容淡，闲数残荷几朵花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小鸾所居疏香阁 其一 次长女昭齐韵","author":"沈宜修","text":"旭日初升榥，瞳胧映绮房。\n梨花犹梦雨，宿蝶半迷香。\n轻阴笼霞彩，繁英低飘翔。\n待将红袖色，帘影一时芳。\n海棠还折取，拂镜试新妆。\n新妆方徐理，窗外弄莺簧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小鸾所居疏香阁 其二 次仲女蕙齐韵","author":"沈宜修","text":"远碧绕庭色，参差映日明。\n竹间翠烟发，竹外双鸠鸣。\n径曲繁枝袅，嫣红入望盈。\n博山微一缕，烟浮画罗生。\n芳树清风起，飘飖落霰轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小鸾所居疏香阁 其三 次季女琼章韵","author":"沈宜修","text":"几点催花雨，疏疏入画楼。\n推帘望远墅，烂锦盈汀洲。\n昨夜碧桃树，凝云缀不流。\n朝来庭草色，挹取暗香浮。\n飞琼方十五，吹笙未解愁。\n次第芳菲节，清吟知未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏初教女学绣有感","author":"沈宜修","text":"忆昔十三馀，倚床初学绣。\n不解春恼人，惟谱花含蔻。\n十五弄琼箫，柳絮吹粘袖。\n挈伴试秋千，芳草花阴逗。\n十六画蛾眉，蛾眉春欲瘦。\n春风二十年，脉脉空长昼。\n流光几度新，晓梦还如旧。\n落尽蔷薇花，正是愁时候。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬申除夜悼二女","author":"沈宜修","text":"恶风吹断鬓，寂寞岁穷天。\n落月照新鬼，伤心送旧年。\n室连双晙帐，肠断一诗篇。\n腊酒浇难醒，寒花泪纸钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日","author":"沈宜修","text":"剪彩肠逾结，伤心景自流。\n春风才七日，泉路自千秋。\n凄断雁非字，悲看月又钩。\n登高一临眺，极目总堪愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋思","author":"沈宜修","text":"鹊镜容消只自知，碧云黄叶动离思。\n闲愁紫袖衫前色，旧恨青春树上丝。\n《子夜》有情新乐府，伤秋多病送归辞。\n江头八月西风起，寥廓天高鸟度迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋夜感怀","author":"沈宜修","text":"凉夜悠悠露气清，晴虫凄切草间鸣。\n高林一叶人初去，短梦三更感乍生。\n自恨回波千曲绕，空馀残月半窗明。\n文园多病悲秋客，摇落西风万古情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"沈宜修","text":"悲秋不是断肠初，风景依依云影疏。\n玉漏自残灯自落，小窗斜月半庭虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽沈宛君诗","author":"沈宪英","text":"楼上春深乳燕来，半帘花影自徘徊。\n子规声里黄昏月，叫断东风梦不回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽诗","author":"沈华鬘","text":"悠悠泉路月为家，寂寂春风梦碧纱。\n自是空思肠断处，归来烟雨送残花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日睡起感悟","author":"叶纨纨","text":"睡馀晚色上，四壁蛩声啾。\n凉月满庭白，寒灯一点愁。\n眇眇犹若梦，恍惚又谓起。\n醒梦若俱非，不知何所似。\n慨然长叹息，生死即如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送妹琼章于归","author":"叶纨纨","text":"昼堂红烛影摇光，箫鼓声繁绕玳梁。\n频传帘外催妆急，无语相看各断肠。\n鸾台宝镜生离色，鸳带罗衣惜别长。\n香霭屏帷凝彩扇，风轻帘幕拂新妆。\n新妆不用铅华饰，梅雪繇来羞并色。\n倾国倾城自绝群，飞琼碧玉惊相识。\n相顾含情泪暗弹，可怜未识别离难。\n遥遥此夜离香阁，去去行装不忍看。\n欲作长歌一送君，未曾搦管泪纷纷。\n追思昔日同游处，惆怅于今各自分。\n昔日同游同笑语，依依朝夕无愁苦。\n春阁连几学弄书，秋床共被听风雨。\n更忆此时君最小，风流早已仙姿袅。\n雪句裁成出众中，新词欲和人还少。\n往事悠悠空自思，从今难再不胜悲。\n休题往日今难再，但愿无愆别后期。\n别后离多相见稀，人生不及雁行飞。\n杳杳离情随去棹，绵绵别恨欲牵衣。\n恋别牵衣不可留，张帆鼓吹溯中流。\n可怜此去应欢笑，莫为思家空自愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日感怀","author":"叶纨纨","text":"罗袂消残旧日香，啼痕几度湿年芳。\n无情懒向东风立，有恨谁怜一梦长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日偶题","author":"叶纨纨","text":"一番摇落一番嗟，咫尺天涯梦里家。\n莫道秋来不憔悴，满庭都是断肠花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭亡妹琼章 其一","author":"叶纨纨","text":"病里俄惊报讣音，狂风号野正凄阴。\n归来哭向残妆处，冷月寒花泪滴深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭亡妹琼章 其二","author":"叶纨纨","text":"别酒同倾九日前，谁知此别即千年。\n疏香阁外黄昏雨，点点苔痕尽黯然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春红于折梅花至偶成","author":"叶小鸾","text":"迟迟帘影映清宵，日照池塘冻欲消。\n公主梅花先傅额，美人杨柳未垂腰。\n纱窗绣冷留馀线，绮阁香浓绕画绡。\n试问待儿芳草色，阶前曾长翠云条？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1007,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭齐姊约归阻风不至","author":"叶小鸾","text":"寒炉拨尽烬微红，漠漠红云黯碧空。\n离别遂如千里月，归期偏怅一帆风。\n愁边花发三春日，梦里年惊两鬓中。\n雨雪满窗消未得，定应握手几时同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1008,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日晓妆","author":"叶小鸾","text":"揽镜晓风清，双蛾岂画成。\n簪花初欲罢，柳外正莺声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1009,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己巳春哭六舅母墓上","author":"叶小鸾","text":"十载恩难报，重泉哭不闻。\n年年春草色，肠断一孤坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1010,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别蕙绸姊 其一","author":"叶小鸾","text":"岁月惊从愁里过，梦魂不向别中分。\n当时最是无情物，疏柳斜阳若送君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1011,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别蕙绸姊 其二","author":"叶小鸾","text":"枝头馀叶堕声干，天外凄凄雁字寒。\n感别却怜双鬓影，竹窗风雨一灯看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1012,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏画屏美人 其一","author":"叶小鸾","text":"庭雪初消月半钩，轻漪月色共相流。\n玉人斜倚寒无那，两点春山日日愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1013,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏画屏美人 其二","author":"叶小鸾","text":"红深翠浅最芳年，闲倚晴空破绮烟。\n何似美人肠断处，海棠和雨晚风前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1014,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蕙绸姊 其一","author":"叶小鸾","text":"丝丝杨柳拂烟轻，总为愁人送别情。\n惟有流波似离恨，共将明月伴君行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1015,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蕙绸姊 其二","author":"叶小鸾","text":"绿酒盈尊未及衔，那堪津树引征帆。\n情知此别难留住，相对无言湿杏衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1016,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙坛奉呈泐师","author":"叶小鸾","text":"身非巫女惯行云，肯对三星蹴绛裙。\n清吹声中轻脱去，瑶天笙鹤两行分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1017,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将授戒再呈泐师","author":"叶小鸾","text":"弱水安能制毒龙，竿头一转拜师功。\n从今别却芙容主，承侍猊座沐下风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1018,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭琼章妹 其一","author":"叶蕙绸","text":"妆台静锁向清晨，满架琴书日覆尘。\n一自疏香人去后，可怜花鸟不知春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1019,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭琼章妹 其二","author":"叶蕙绸","text":"生别那知死别难，长眠长似夜漫漫。\n春来燕子穿帘入，可认雕阑锁昼寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1020,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽叶昭齐甥女二首 其一","author":"沈媛","text":"柳絮因风淡远空，海棠照月雾香蒙。\n莫愁强字卢家妇，闭影梨花芳雪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1021,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽叶昭齐甥女二首 其二","author":"沈媛","text":"凫藻频温语砌蛩，不教诗卷罥蛛封。\n夜台属和琼章句，花落庭幽锁径重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1022,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽叶琼章甥女二首 其一","author":"沈媛","text":"仿佛琼姿照笔床，寒归空阁燕归梁。\n最怜琴绝流波引，句里梅花度暗香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1023,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽叶琼章甥女二首 其二","author":"沈媛","text":"十七龄来聚沫馀，芙蓉城冷待爰居。\n臂文朱缕他年识，祇恐天都署掌书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1024,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽昭齐表妹三首 其一","author":"周兰秀","text":"闲窗琼月照幽姿，芳雪飘零有所思。\n莫谓愁春春不觉，语愁今可共瑶期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1025,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽昭齐表妹三首 其二","author":"周兰秀","text":"遗诗犹贮旧书帏，林壑缘深梦后非。\n檐鸟倦啼花不扫，古丘残月倩魂归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽昭齐表妹三首 其三","author":"周兰秀","text":"三生石上指空弹，读罢《楞严》静里观。\n尘土何堪埋玉树，梨花小阁又春寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽琼章表妹三首 其一","author":"周兰秀","text":"性带烟霞秀可餐，蕉窗煮梦静无喧。\n只今韵魄翛然去，何必双飞文采鸳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽琼章表妹三首 其二","author":"周兰秀","text":"十咏探梅护径苔，柔情端不为春来。\n琴亡谁谱江南弄，空使疏香度夜台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":1029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]